MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: In fiscal year 2025, review fees accounted for the majority of our revenue at 77.26%.

asr-000192
00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:58.060
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Followed by registration fees at 13.06% and miscellaneous income at 9.41%.

asr-000193
00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:11.440
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Revenue collection in January to June 2025 reached 67.97 million, achieving 70.80% of the 96 million target.

asr-000194
00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:18.400
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: In January to June 2026, despite a higher target of 98 million,

asr-000195
00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:34.260
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: collections declined to 62 points, a 5.36 million decrease in actual collections,

asr-000196
00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:44.720
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: and a 6.92 percentage point drop in efficiency, signaling weaker revenue performance year on year.

asr-000197
00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.620
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: In fiscal year 2025, the MTRCB,

asr-000198
