asr-000199
00:20:52.860 --> 00:21:01.580
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Compliance remained high, with 99.90% of entities under our jurisdiction adhering to MTRCB rules.

asr-000200
00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:05.060
