Senator Erwin Tulfo: If Congress expands MTRCB's mandate to online platforms, kasi po ngayon parang marami na pong lumalabas pag binuksan mo ang TV, may mga Netflix, et cetera, et cetera, social media and online games, is MTRCB ready technologically, financially and organizationally to assume that responsibility?

asr-000338
00:30:27.060 --> 00:30:37.560
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: First, Mr. Chairman, I would like to emphasize that the MTRCB is not for prohibition but for regulation.

asr-000339
00:30:38.300 --> 00:30:51.480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: We will accept the challenge if the legislators would include the said online services, streaming platforms,

asr-000340
00:30:51.480 --> 00:30:57.040
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: the subscription video on-demand services in our jurisdiction or our provision.

asr-000341
00:30:57.060 --> 00:31:11.400
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: However, it would entail a lot of coordination with the said stakeholders, such as the OTTs, the over-the-top, and the online streaming services.

asr-000342
00:31:12.500 --> 00:31:19.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi pag minsan, late at night, when I turn my TV, when I get home, I watch some movies.

asr-000343
00:31:20.340 --> 00:31:25.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nakakagulat na lang, bigla na lang may kubot-kubot na babae dyan.

asr-000344
00:31:26.040 --> 00:31:26.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And I didn't know that.

asr-000345
00:31:27.060 --> 00:31:32.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: A young man, my son, behind me was like looking also.

asr-000346
00:31:32.660 --> 00:31:34.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, I don't know.

asr-000347
00:31:35.020 --> 00:31:43.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung nangyari nga sa akin, maybe sa ibang mga household na wala naman kasing restriction when you turn on dahil subscription po yun.

asr-000348
00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:47.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, yun po yung tinatanong natin, can we do something about it?

asr-000349
00:31:47.640 --> 00:31:53.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, kaya nga, if we're given by Congress an expanded mandate, can you do it?

asr-000350
00:31:54.340 --> 00:31:55.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And when can you do that?

asr-000351
00:31:57.060 --> 00:32:04.340
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Mr. Chairman, if I may, it would be, yes, it would be feasible.

asr-000352
00:32:04.700 --> 00:32:06.660
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Yes, the MTRCB can do it.

asr-000353
00:32:06.880 --> 00:32:11.040
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: But I would like to reiterate that it is only the regulation that we can do.

asr-000354
00:32:11.040 --> 00:32:20.860
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: I'd like to clarify that the movies that will be exhibited in the online streaming platforms do not need to go through prior constraint,

asr-000355
00:32:21.280 --> 00:32:26.140
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: which is what we are really pushing for, even in the past hearings.

asr-000356
00:32:26.400 --> 00:32:27.040
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: I have observed.

asr-000357
00:32:27.060 --> 00:32:32.860
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Already mentioned, with regard to the online streaming and the subscription video on-demand services,

asr-000358
00:32:33.040 --> 00:32:40.980
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: what we need from them is to establish a very effective feedback mechanism

asr-000359
00:32:40.980 --> 00:32:47.060
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: where they will commit to accountability and responsiveness to the MTRCB

asr-000360
00:32:47.660 --> 00:32:55.880
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: for when complaints are raised and expressed to the said online streaming provider,

asr-000361
00:32:55.880 --> 00:32:56.880
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: their share.

asr-000362
00:32:57.060 --> 00:32:59.140
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: So, there should be an answer.

asr-000363
00:32:59.280 --> 00:33:03.280
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: There should be a commitment that they will work on these concerns

asr-000364
00:33:03.280 --> 00:33:06.720
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: and that they're very much willing to help the MTRCB.

asr-000365
00:33:06.720 --> 00:33:10.740
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Currently, we are working with Netflix and HBO and Disney,

asr-000366
00:33:11.200 --> 00:33:12.880
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: and they've been very cooperative.

asr-000367
00:33:13.180 --> 00:33:14.400
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: I'm happy to share, Mr. Chair.

asr-000368
00:33:14.820 --> 00:33:19.760
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: However, with the rampant problems that we are facing today,

asr-000369
00:33:19.920 --> 00:33:22.020
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: I think it is faced globally.

asr-000370
00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:26.840
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: We really need to reiterate that this regulation,

asr-000371
00:33:27.060 --> 00:33:27.780
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: as possible,

asr-000372
00:33:28.460 --> 00:33:32.800
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: but we would need their cooperation and their coordination as well.

asr-000373
00:33:33.900 --> 00:33:34.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: All right.

asr-000374
00:33:35.020 --> 00:33:36.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Because my concern, ma'am,

asr-000375
00:33:36.700 --> 00:33:44.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: is the growing violence in schools right now

asr-000376
00:33:44.540 --> 00:33:47.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: because kids are watching online games,

asr-000377
00:33:48.300 --> 00:33:50.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung access po nila sa mga online games.

asr-000378
00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:55.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Do you have any steps to address this?

asr-000379
00:33:55.800 --> 00:33:56.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya pa paano?

asr-000380
00:33:56.400 --> 00:33:59.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Though you don't have these powers yet,

asr-000381
00:33:59.680 --> 00:34:04.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: which are being linked to violent online games and violent content,

asr-000382
00:34:04.180 --> 00:34:05.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung nangyari po sa Samwanga,

asr-000383
00:34:05.800 --> 00:34:12.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, isang online game po yun na nire-record pa nung bata yung shootout na yun,

asr-000384
00:34:14.600 --> 00:34:16.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: may steps po ba kayo?

asr-000385
00:34:16.400 --> 00:34:18.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are you already talking about this?

asr-000386
00:34:18.740 --> 00:34:21.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How do you, your agency, will control this?

asr-000387
00:34:21.500 --> 00:34:25.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And I don't know if OMB can also help us on this matter.

asr-000388
00:34:25.240 --> 00:34:25.340
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Sure.

asr-000389
00:34:26.400 --> 00:34:27.420
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Currently, Mr. Chairman,

asr-000390
00:34:27.560 --> 00:34:30.140
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: it is not under the purview of the MTRCB

asr-000391
00:34:30.140 --> 00:34:33.380
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: with regard to online gaming and video games

asr-000392
00:34:33.380 --> 00:34:38.860
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: as it is a totally different structure from what we are currently doing.

asr-000393
00:34:39.160 --> 00:34:40.460
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: But we have explored

asr-000394
00:34:40.460 --> 00:34:43.800
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: and we are continuing the discussions on this exploration.

asr-000395
00:34:44.380 --> 00:34:48.040
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: And I would like to yield to the Executive Director of the MTRCB

asr-000396
00:34:48.040 --> 00:34:53.260
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: for the reporting of the exploratory researches we've made.

asr-000397
00:34:54.560 --> 00:34:55.560
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Thank you.

asr-000398
00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:56.740
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Senator,

asr-000399
00:34:57.640 --> 00:34:59.800
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: as regards violence in social media,

asr-000400
00:35:00.200 --> 00:35:04.980
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: while it is a different area,

asr-000401
00:35:06.080 --> 00:35:09.340
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: because MTRCB, as we are saying,

asr-000402
00:35:09.680 --> 00:35:12.120
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: we are involved only in sa content, no?

asr-000403
00:35:12.620 --> 00:35:14.880
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: And unfortunately, online contents,

asr-000404
00:35:15.300 --> 00:35:16.420
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: hindi pa rin sa amin.

asr-000405
00:35:16.760 --> 00:35:20.160
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: But there are studies globally

asr-000406
00:35:20.160 --> 00:35:23.620
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: regarding this violence in media, in social media.

asr-000407
00:35:23.620 --> 00:35:25.500
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: One of them is the,

asr-000408
00:35:25.500 --> 00:35:30.640
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: do not amplify regulatory principle for social media,

asr-000409
00:35:30.800 --> 00:35:34.020
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: which means we can,

asr-000410
00:35:34.580 --> 00:35:37.520
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: as a country,

asr-000411
00:35:37.740 --> 00:35:40.420
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: can create policies that require major platform

asr-000412
00:35:40.420 --> 00:35:44.500
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: to address algorithmic amplification of violent content,

asr-000413
00:35:45.260 --> 00:35:48.720
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: recommendation of increasingly extreme material,

asr-000414
00:35:49.080 --> 00:35:51.060
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: autoplay of violent videos,

asr-000415
00:35:51.620 --> 00:35:53.840
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: viral circulation of graphic violence,

asr-000416
00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:55.340
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: monetization of violent content,

asr-000417
00:35:55.340 --> 00:35:59.580
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: and recommendation of violent material to minors.

asr-000418
00:36:00.580 --> 00:36:02.840
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: If there will be a law

asr-000419
00:36:03.480 --> 00:36:08.240
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: na hahawakan ang iyong mga social media na ito,

asr-000420
00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:14.060
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: we can tell them na dapat hindi naka-autoplay ang mga violent content

asr-000421
00:36:14.560 --> 00:36:16.120
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: sa mga materials natin.

asr-000422
00:36:16.460 --> 00:36:20.780
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Dapat hindi, kung pwede, hindi ma-monetize.

asr-000423
00:36:21.180 --> 00:36:23.460
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Because sa totoo lang,

asr-000424
00:36:23.460 --> 00:36:24.700
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: isa sa mga,

asr-000425
00:36:25.340 --> 00:36:27.780
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: sa mga motivation ng mga content creators,

asr-000426
00:36:27.780 --> 00:36:31.340
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: syempre, mamamonetize yung gagawin nilang content.

asr-000427
00:36:31.340 --> 00:36:35.220
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: If these videos, at yung mga violent videos,

asr-000428
00:36:35.220 --> 00:36:39.060
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: sex videos, ay made-demonetize,

asr-000429
00:36:39.060 --> 00:36:42.940
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: I think, mababawasan yung mga ganong materials.

asr-000430
00:36:42.940 --> 00:36:46.940
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: And then, yung algorithmic amplification,

asr-000431
00:36:46.940 --> 00:36:52.860
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: we can tell Meta or other social media platforms na

asr-000432
00:36:52.860 --> 00:36:55.180
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: automatic, walang algorithmic amplification,

asr-000433
00:36:55.180 --> 00:36:59.180
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: automatic walang recommendations,

asr-000434
00:36:59.180 --> 00:37:00.820
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: especially sa minors.

asr-000435
00:37:00.820 --> 00:37:03.240
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Automatic block sa minors, yung mga ganon.

asr-000436
00:37:04.020 --> 00:37:08.880
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: We can also introduce a stronger protection for minors

asr-000437
00:37:08.880 --> 00:37:13.000
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: by safety by default for minors principle.

asr-000438
00:37:14.500 --> 00:37:16.620
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Yun nga po, as I said, a while ago,

asr-000439
00:37:17.360 --> 00:37:20.860
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: violent content should not be algorithmically recommended,

asr-000440
00:37:21.700 --> 00:37:24.160
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: graphic content should be age-gated.

asr-000441
00:37:24.300 --> 00:37:25.020
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Autoplay.

asr-000442
00:37:25.020 --> 00:37:27.020
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: violent content should be

asr-000443
00:37:27.020 --> 00:37:29.100
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: disabled. Accounts should

asr-000444
00:37:29.100 --> 00:37:31.120
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: have stronger privacy settings.

asr-000445
00:37:31.580 --> 00:37:33.280
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Live streaming should have enhanced

asr-000446
00:37:33.280 --> 00:37:35.020
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: safeguards. Repeated

asr-000447
00:37:35.020 --> 00:37:37.000
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: exposure to violent content should trigger

asr-000448
00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:38.540
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: additional safeguards.

asr-000449
00:37:39.860 --> 00:37:41.220
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: There are also studies

asr-000450
00:37:41.220 --> 00:37:42.660
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: about or push for

asr-000451
00:37:42.660 --> 00:37:45.440
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: creation of violent content

asr-000452
00:37:45.440 --> 00:37:46.860
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: emergency protocols

asr-000453
00:37:46.860 --> 00:37:48.340
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: in some countries.

asr-000454
00:37:48.960 --> 00:37:50.680
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: This would be particularly

asr-000455
00:37:50.680 --> 00:37:53.000
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: useful in the Philippines for events

asr-000456
00:37:53.000 --> 00:37:54.200
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: such as mass shootings,

asr-000457
00:37:54.200 --> 00:37:56.200
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: terrorist attacks, hostage situations,

asr-000458
00:37:57.360 --> 00:37:58.400
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: riots, and

asr-000459
00:37:58.400 --> 00:37:58.940
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: other

asr-000460
00:37:58.940 --> 00:38:02.280
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: violent contents or

asr-000461
00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:04.420
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: incidents. Platforms

asr-000462
00:38:04.420 --> 00:38:06.200
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: should have emergency escalation mechanisms

asr-000463
00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:08.060
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: with government

asr-000464
00:38:08.060 --> 00:38:08.960
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: authorities.

asr-000465
00:38:11.460 --> 00:38:13.940
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: We should treat live streaming

asr-000466
00:38:13.940 --> 00:38:16.120
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: differently from ordinary posts

asr-000467
00:38:16.120 --> 00:38:17.660
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: because

asr-000468
00:38:17.660 --> 00:38:20.160
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: the harm happens before

asr-000469
00:38:20.160 --> 00:38:21.440
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: traditional moderation

asr-000470
00:38:21.440 --> 00:38:23.220
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: can respond.

asr-000471
00:38:23.700 --> 00:38:24.180
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Pwede mangyari.

asr-000472
00:38:24.200 --> 00:38:26.100
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: May mangyaring hindi maganda kaya

asr-000473
00:38:26.100 --> 00:38:28.080
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: we should treat live streaming

asr-000474
00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:29.820
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: differently from regular

asr-000475
00:38:29.820 --> 00:38:31.400
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: video posting.

asr-000476
00:38:33.200 --> 00:38:34.120
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Again,

asr-000477
00:38:34.860 --> 00:38:36.740
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: yung pong established

asr-000478
00:38:36.740 --> 00:38:38.680
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: platform accountability

asr-000479
00:38:38.680 --> 00:38:41.280
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: kailangan po natin

asr-000480
00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:43.040
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: i-implement

asr-000481
00:38:43.040 --> 00:38:44.780
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: or pwedeng gawing policy.

asr-000482
00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:46.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So this is your study.

asr-000483
00:38:46.940 --> 00:38:48.080
MTRCB Executive Director Roberto Diciembre: Understudy po ito.

asr-000484
00:38:48.500 --> 00:38:50.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Unless you will be given

asr-000485
00:38:50.400 --> 00:38:52.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: by Congress, by

asr-000486
00:38:52.120 --> 00:38:54.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Congress and the Senate,

asr-000487
00:38:54.200 --> 00:38:56.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: to expand your powers

asr-000488
00:38:56.380 --> 00:38:57.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: to look into

asr-000489
00:38:57.700 --> 00:39:00.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: online platforms,

asr-000490
00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:01.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: social media, and online games.

asr-000491
00:39:02.260 --> 00:39:03.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: For now, wala ako kayo magagawa.

asr-000492
00:39:04.080 --> 00:39:05.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes. Alright. Thank you.

asr-000493
00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:08.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Moving forward, Chairperson.

asr-000494
00:39:08.860 --> 00:39:09.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano po ang

asr-000495
00:39:09.640 --> 00:39:16.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ginagawa ng MTRCB right now

asr-000496
00:39:16.380 --> 00:39:18.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: dito po sa exhibition ng materials

asr-000497
00:39:18.300 --> 00:39:20.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ng mga unregistered

asr-000498
00:39:20.340 --> 00:39:21.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: entities considering

asr-000499
00:39:21.820 --> 00:39:22.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: the issue.

asr-000500
00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:22.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So,

asr-000501
00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:26.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: you look through logik

asr-000502
00:39:26.120 --> 00:39:27.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ng mga

asr-000503
00:39:27.500 --> 00:39:28.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: unregistered entities

asr-000504
00:39:28.940 --> 00:39:30.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: accepting movies

asr-000505
00:39:30.160 --> 00:39:30.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: without

asr-000506
00:39:30.480 --> 00:39:30.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: a

asr-000507
00:39:30.600 --> 00:39:31.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: limit.

