00:39:35.060 --> 00:39:35.840
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The

asr-000509
00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:38.800
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Committee of the

asr-000510
00:39:38.800 --> 00:39:39.820
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: MTRCB

asr-000511
00:39:39.820 --> 00:39:41.400
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: right now.

asr-000512
00:39:42.440 --> 00:39:44.320
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: And the Chairperson of the

