MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: first.

asr-000516
00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:51.980
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The MTRCB has its own monitoring

asr-000517
00:39:51.980 --> 00:39:54.180
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: inspection unit along with our

asr-000518
00:39:54.180 --> 00:39:58.320
