asr-000519
00:39:58.320 --> 00:40:06.260
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: inspection consistently. That helps us identify the violations or the violators,

asr-000520
00:40:06.660 --> 00:40:13.340
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: especially in the cinemas. But we also do our own inspections around the country wherein we go

asr-000521
