asr-000532
00:41:23.400 --> 00:41:31.360
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Mr. Chairman, first of all, yes we are in the process of reviewing our reassessing our processes.

asr-000533
00:41:31.360 --> 00:41:36.480
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: However, I just want to clear this up. That regarding the Lost Sabungeros movie,

asr-000534
00:41:37.820 --> 00:41:45.020
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: the board consistently reviews each and every material that is submitted to us carefully.

asr-000535
00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:47.780
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: And it would not be detrimental to...

asr-000536
00:41:48.060 --> 00:41:56.260
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: nor a disservice to the Filipino viewers to ask for additional requirements consistent with our subjudice rule

asr-000537
00:41:56.260 --> 00:42:06.280
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: because this is only an exercise of prudence for an administrative agency that is a regulatory body as well.

