asr-000545
00:42:46.360 --> 00:42:52.840
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: we called the production for an adjugatory hearing.

asr-000546
00:42:53.500 --> 00:42:58.760
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: And in that hearing, we discussed how they can prevent this from happening again.

asr-000547
00:42:58.980 --> 00:43:08.460
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: And in so doing, we required them to assign a compliance officer who would monitor their program as it airs.

asr-000548
00:43:08.460 --> 00:43:15.480
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: So this compliance officer will be the one responsible to the MTRCB.

asr-000549
00:43:16.360 --> 00:43:19.380
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: In case of live violations.

asr-000550
00:43:20.080 --> 00:43:23.480
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: And also, we required them to undergo a compliance seminar,

asr-000551
00:43:24.100 --> 00:43:30.020
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: which we do to all violators of MTRCB rules.

asr-000552
00:43:30.200 --> 00:43:37.740
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: We conduct compliance seminars and we teach them how to avoid violating the rules of the MTRCB.

asr-000553
00:43:37.740 --> 00:43:44.600
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: And we inculcate in their minds that the importance of following the rules is not really to avoid penalties,

asr-000554
00:43:44.800 --> 00:43:45.740
MTRCB Board Member Antonio Ricardo ?Jojo? Salomon Jr.: but to ensure that we...

asr-000555
00:43:46.360 --> 00:43:48.200
