asr-000594
00:45:37.320 --> 00:45:49.100
MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: The MTRCB disapproves of such behavior and they are consistently reminded. We have compliance seminars for the shows and the hosts as well.

