MTRCB Chairperson Diorella Maria ?Lala? Sotto-Antonio: Taken care of by their own production, their respective productions, Mr. Chairman. However, it is already in the process with the MTRCB that they have their own continuing workshops with, no, we have our continuing workshops with them so that they are reminded.

