01:06:46.920 --> 01:06:47.280
OMB OIC Chairperson Dennis Lorenzo B. Pinlac: Yes, sir.

asr-000775
01:06:47.740 --> 01:06:57.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Didn't you inform the DBM na you guys are winding down na the budget given to you last year is supposed to last for three months?

asr-000776
01:06:57.740 --> 01:07:02.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi po ba, when they asked you for your ikang budget proposal, didn't you tell them that,

asr-000777
01:07:03.580 --> 01:07:11.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary, DBM, we're supposed to wind down this year, thereby, we should not be submitting any more budget?

asr-000778
01:07:11.500 --> 01:07:23.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Because what we're doing here, and you already know pala, na magkakaroon po kayo ng your employees will be transferred either to the FDCP or IPO.

asr-000779
01:07:24.060 --> 01:07:29.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit po kayo nag-submit? Didn't you inform the DBM na we're winding down, Secretary?

asr-000780
01:07:29.580 --> 01:07:32.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi kahit to kami, we're waiting for the reply.

asr-000781
01:07:32.540 --> 01:07:32.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-000782
01:07:33.580 --> 01:07:41.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, I don't know kung alam ba ng DBM, were they informed, pero the mere fact that you submitted the budget proposal for 2027,

asr-000783
01:07:42.800 --> 01:07:52.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: baka hindi ho ninyo na-informed sila, pero we informed you, the Senate informed you last year, that the funds given to you for this year is for winding down.

asr-000784
01:07:53.120 --> 01:07:54.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano nangyari, sir?

asr-000785
01:07:56.500 --> 01:08:00.720
OMB OIC Chairperson Dennis Lorenzo B. Pinlac: Chairman, we have informed po yung DBM po, yung winding down po.

asr-000786
01:08:00.800 --> 01:08:03.200
OMB OIC Chairperson Dennis Lorenzo B. Pinlac: Actually, we have submitted our position paper po.

asr-000787
01:08:03.580 --> 01:08:11.720
OMB OIC Chairperson Dennis Lorenzo B. Pinlac: To them nung August 7, and we have been very transparent po dun sa aming coordination with them, sir.

asr-000788
