Senator Erwin Tulfo: I'm not blaming you.

asr-000789
01:08:13.680 --> 01:08:23.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I was just wondering what was the reaction or the reason given by DBM na nabinigyan pa po kayo ng budget for next year.

asr-000790
01:08:24.620 --> 01:08:26.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I know it is not your fault.

asr-000791
