Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mr. DBM,

asr-000794
01:08:33.580 --> 01:08:46.720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary, kami po ay, this is supposed to be our last year, dahil kami po ay i-absorb ng either ng FDCP, yung aming personnel, or IPO.

asr-000795
01:08:47.120 --> 01:08:48.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Did you inform them about that?

asr-000796
01:08:50.380 --> 01:08:52.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes, sir. We have informed them.

asr-000797
01:08:53.880 --> 01:08:58.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay. Do we have the resource person from the Department of Budget and Management?

asr-000798
01:08:58.620 --> 01:08:59.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: There you go.

asr-000799
01:08:59.460 --> 01:09:02.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Director May Pina, what is going on in here?

asr-000800
01:09:03.580 --> 01:09:13.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Last year, Senate President, well, hindi pa siya Senate President, Finance Chair po po si Senate President Wingachelyan,

asr-000801
01:09:14.380 --> 01:09:24.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: who defended their budget last year, and specifically, sinasabi niya na ito pong budget for last year na ibinigay sa OMB,

asr-000802
01:09:24.240 --> 01:09:27.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: and he was the one who defended it, is for winding down.

asr-000803
01:09:27.640 --> 01:09:30.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Why did you guys give budget to OMB?

asr-000804
01:09:30.500 --> 01:09:33.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Eh, alam po ninyo na they're winding down.

asr-000805
01:09:33.580 --> 01:09:37.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I-absorb po sila ng, kung hindi ng FDCP, ang IPO po.

asr-000806
01:09:37.660 --> 01:09:38.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Why is that?

asr-000807
01:09:39.860 --> 01:09:40.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Weren't you informed?

asr-000808
01:09:41.940 --> 01:09:43.720
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: Good morning po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000809
01:09:44.160 --> 01:09:46.220
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: The DBM is informed po.

asr-000810
01:09:46.480 --> 01:09:54.560
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: Actually, it's in the special provision po of the OMB sa JA po natin, 2026.

asr-000811
01:09:54.560 --> 01:09:58.520
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: But it was mentioned po kasi in the special provision that,

asr-000812
01:09:59.040 --> 01:10:00.860
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: that,

asr-000813
01:10:01.360 --> 01:10:03.560
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: the OMB will still be,

asr-000814
01:10:03.580 --> 01:10:06.480
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: subject to the GOP po,

asr-000815
01:10:06.480 --> 01:10:08.760
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: the Government Optimization Plan po,

asr-000816
01:10:08.760 --> 01:10:11.460
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: optimization program po of the government po that time.

asr-000817
01:10:11.460 --> 01:10:15.020
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: So, while waiting for the results of the GOP po,

asr-000818
01:10:15.020 --> 01:10:18.700
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: we provided the Tier 1 po for the OMB,

asr-000819
01:10:18.700 --> 01:10:25.280
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: just in case po, hindi po kasi matuloy siya or maresolved po within the year for 2027,

asr-000820
01:10:25.280 --> 01:10:30.960
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: meron pong magagamit ang OMB, specifically, lalo na po sa personnel services po nila.

asr-000821
01:10:31.700 --> 01:10:33.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: My next question is, bakit tumaas pa po?

asr-000822
01:10:33.580 --> 01:10:35.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung winding down na po sila.

asr-000823
01:10:35.580 --> 01:10:39.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: From GAA 47, nagdagdagan, well,

asr-000824
01:10:39.580 --> 01:10:45.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: 6 million po, 2027 NEP.

asr-000825
01:10:45.580 --> 01:10:47.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What is the reason behind?

asr-000826
01:10:47.580 --> 01:10:48.580
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: NEP level lang po.

asr-000827
01:10:48.580 --> 01:10:51.580
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: Yung nag-increase lang po sa kanila is the PS po.

asr-000828
01:10:52.580 --> 01:10:53.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Personal services?

asr-000829
01:10:53.580 --> 01:10:54.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dagdag-dag po sila ng tao?

asr-000830
01:10:54.580 --> 01:10:57.580
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: NEP level lang naman po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000831
01:10:57.580 --> 01:10:59.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Oh, NEP level.

asr-000832
01:11:00.580 --> 01:11:01.580
DBM OIC Director III May L. Piñga: For the PS po.

asr-000833
01:11:01.580 --> 01:11:02.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-000834
01:11:03.580 --> 01:11:04.580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: All right.

asr-000835
