FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Next slide, please.

asr-001254
01:33:47.820 --> 01:33:55.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: This is just the breakdown of the budget per division or per section of our program.

asr-001255
01:33:55.320 --> 01:34:02.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Again, for the personnel services, we have 38.3 million.

asr-001256
01:34:02.780 --> 01:34:07.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: That's across from general administration, the FIPDP,

asr-001257
01:34:08.100 --> 01:34:10.720
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: or the Film Industry Promotion Development Program,

asr-001258
01:34:10.860 --> 01:34:13.560
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and the Film Heritage Preservation Program.

asr-001259
01:34:13.560 --> 01:34:21.560
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then we also have a budget of 45.6 million for GAS.

asr-001260
01:34:21.900 --> 01:34:25.060
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And again, 37.3 million for the salary of...

asr-001261
01:34:25.320 --> 01:34:29.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: of our COS personnel and other mandatory expenses.

asr-001262
01:34:29.580 --> 01:34:36.720
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So it's taking a lot of our budget in terms of implementing of our programs.

asr-001263
01:34:36.980 --> 01:34:41.700
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Education Division, we are allocating 21.2 million.

asr-001264
01:34:42.100 --> 01:34:48.260
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: For Festivals Division, this includes our support for our regional film festivals

asr-001265
01:34:48.260 --> 01:34:55.300
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and participation of Filipino filmmakers and FDCP for international film festivals.

asr-001266
01:34:55.320 --> 01:34:59.580
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Exhibition Division, we have 12.2 million budget.

asr-001267
01:34:59.580 --> 01:35:08.300
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Basically, this is for the operation of our four Cinematheques and the OneFlix application, streaming platform.

asr-001268
01:35:08.960 --> 01:35:15.000
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Film Philippines Office, we have allocated 58.3 million budget.

asr-001269
01:35:15.640 --> 01:35:20.680
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: This is the biggest chunk among the budget because this is the incentive programs that we provide

asr-001270
01:35:20.680 --> 01:35:25.300
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: in promoting the Philippines as a filming location for foreign production.

asr-001271
01:35:25.320 --> 01:35:31.540
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Production Support Unit, we are allocating 51.6 million.

asr-001272
01:35:31.700 --> 01:35:32.500
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: This is also...

asr-001273
01:35:32.500 --> 01:35:37.760
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: This is the second highest for the budget allocation that we have for all the programs of FDCP.

asr-001274
01:35:38.340 --> 01:35:40.140
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Again, this is a production incentive.

asr-001275
01:35:40.760 --> 01:35:46.200
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then these two programs, the Film Philippines Office and the Production Support Unit,

asr-001276
01:35:47.120 --> 01:35:50.220
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: given that they have the biggest chunk of the budget,

asr-001277
01:35:50.220 --> 01:35:53.840
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: they are also giving us the most economic return ratio,

asr-001278
01:35:54.080 --> 01:35:55.220
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: ratio meaning that...

asr-001279
01:35:55.320 --> 01:36:02.620
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for the incentives that we are providing for the Film Location Incentive Program,

asr-001280
01:36:02.620 --> 01:36:06.220
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: there is a 1 is to 13 economic return ratio,

asr-001281
01:36:06.220 --> 01:36:10.880
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: which means for every 1 peso grant that we are providing, 13 pesos goes back to the economy.

asr-001282
01:36:10.880 --> 01:36:15.920
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Those projects are purely foreign projects that are shooting here in the Philippines.

asr-001283
01:36:15.920 --> 01:36:19.560
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the projects that are co-produced by Filipino producers,

asr-001284
01:36:19.560 --> 01:36:25.300
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: the economic return ratio is 1 is to 16, meaning for every 1 peso that we provide as grant,

asr-001285
01:36:25.320 --> 01:36:27.660
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: 16 pesos goes back to the economy.

asr-001286
01:36:28.140 --> 01:36:31.620
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the local production grant that we are providing,

asr-001287
01:36:31.800 --> 01:36:34.520
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: there is a 1 is to 6 economic return ratio,

asr-001288
01:36:34.680 --> 01:36:39.020
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: meaning 1 peso grant, 6 pesos goes back to the economy.

asr-001289
01:36:39.260 --> 01:36:47.140
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So the local film production really has benefits in terms of our economic growth.

asr-001290
01:36:48.000 --> 01:36:52.240
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then other divisions, the Office of the Chairman and the OED,

asr-001291
01:36:52.440 --> 01:36:54.400
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: as well as the Special Projects Unit,

asr-001292
01:36:55.320 --> 01:36:57.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we have a budget of 6.5 million.

asr-001293
01:36:57.320 --> 01:36:59.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Policy and Planning Division,

asr-001294
01:36:59.320 --> 01:37:01.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we have 6.5 million budget.

asr-001295
01:37:01.320 --> 01:37:03.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: For the Communications Unit,

asr-001296
01:37:03.320 --> 01:37:05.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we have 1.8 million budget.

asr-001297
01:37:05.320 --> 01:37:07.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And again, for the Philippine Film Archives,

asr-001298
01:37:07.320 --> 01:37:09.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: you only have 6.2 million budget.

asr-001299
01:37:09.320 --> 01:37:14.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And a total of 276.94 million budget for the MOOE of the agency.

asr-001300
01:37:14.320 --> 01:37:18.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So that's it for the breakdown of our 2027-F approved budget.

asr-001301
01:37:18.320 --> 01:37:20.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And of course, we have a wish list.

asr-001302
01:37:20.320 --> 01:37:24.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So basically, we have cut down some of our programs

asr-001303
01:37:24.080 --> 01:37:27.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: that are already growing.

asr-001304
01:37:27.080 --> 01:37:36.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And hopefully, we could be able to have some of these be granted.

asr-001305
01:37:36.080 --> 01:37:40.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: On the list is the film incentives.

asr-001306
01:37:42.080 --> 01:37:46.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: We have a request of 109.8 million.

asr-001307
01:37:46.080 --> 01:37:53.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: That's for the backlogs because the incentives that we are providing to our grantees are in tranches.

asr-001308
01:37:54.080 --> 01:37:59.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So the 109 million accounts to the second and third tranches of the grants.

asr-001309
01:37:59.080 --> 01:38:02.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the 2027 Film Location Incentive Programs,

asr-001310
01:38:02.080 --> 01:38:05.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we would like to request additional 120 million

asr-001311
01:38:05.080 --> 01:38:14.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because it's expected that we will be releasing around 120 million for five projects,

asr-001312
01:38:14.080 --> 01:38:21.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: which could bring in half a billion pesos in the country for their shooting here.

asr-001313
01:38:21.080 --> 01:38:22.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And

asr-001314
01:38:22.080 --> 01:38:29.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: next is for the film licensing for Interagency Program and Philippine Embassies Program.

asr-001315
01:38:29.080 --> 01:38:35.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: We are requesting 1.1 million because we are also supporting our posts abroad

asr-001316
01:38:35.080 --> 01:38:40.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: when they conduct Filipino film festivals or other cultural activities that are related to film.

asr-001317
01:38:40.080 --> 01:38:48.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And of course, purchase of production equipment accessories for our Cinemathèque amounting to 1.1 million,

asr-001318
01:38:48.080 --> 01:38:50.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: as well as projectors for our Cinemathèque amounting to 1.1 million.

asr-001319
01:38:50.080 --> 01:38:58.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then we have quite a lot of requests.

asr-001320
01:38:58.080 --> 01:39:06.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So we also have requested 895,000 for our Cinemathèque Center Programming,

asr-001321
01:39:06.080 --> 01:39:10.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: World Day for Audiovisual Heritage and Pelikula ng Bayan Caravan,

asr-001322
01:39:10.080 --> 01:39:12.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: documentado in Asian cinema.

asr-001323
01:39:12.080 --> 01:39:17.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So we would like to highlight that the Pelikula ng Bayan activity is basically,

asr-001324
01:39:17.080 --> 01:39:19.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we are going around different towns.

asr-001325
01:39:19.080 --> 01:39:24.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and cities in the country to showcase various films,

asr-001326
01:39:24.080 --> 01:39:27.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: particularly classic films that we have restored.

asr-001327
01:39:27.080 --> 01:39:32.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then the Cine 50, we are requesting additional 1.5 million.

asr-001328
01:39:32.080 --> 01:39:40.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: This is showcasing various films at a lower price of ticket amounting to only 50 pesos.

asr-001329
01:39:40.080 --> 01:39:49.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then additional value of 11 million for features,

asr-001330
01:39:49.080 --> 01:39:56.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: film love, documentary love,

asr-001331
01:39:56.080 --> 01:39:58.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: bring in here Filipino,

asr-001332
01:39:58.080 --> 01:40:02.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and festival town hall meeting and engagements amounting to 1.7 million.

asr-001333
01:40:02.080 --> 01:40:07.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And OneFlix Cinemathèque Integrated Marketing Promotions, 2 million.

asr-001334
01:40:07.080 --> 01:40:13.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: OneFlix Anniversary and Films for Peace Short Film Competition, 1 million again.

asr-001335
01:40:13.080 --> 01:40:17.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the Group 2 list of our wish list.

asr-001336
01:40:17.080 --> 01:40:22.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So the first request is amounting to 451,000

asr-001337
01:40:22.080 --> 01:40:25.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for the procurement of preservation supplies

asr-001338
01:40:25.080 --> 01:40:31.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and 551,000 for the procurement of digitization equipment and photo scanner

asr-001339
01:40:31.080 --> 01:40:34.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because with the advent of continuous growing of technology,

asr-001340
01:40:34.080 --> 01:40:37.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we really have to update and upgrade the equipment that we have

asr-001341
01:40:37.080 --> 01:40:41.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for the preservation and archiving facilities that we have.

asr-001342
01:40:41.080 --> 01:40:46.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And another 50 million for the restoration of 59 titles

asr-001343
01:40:46.080 --> 01:40:48.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for 2027.

asr-001344
01:40:48.080 --> 01:40:56.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So we have already identified films that we can restore in 2027.

asr-001345
01:40:56.080 --> 01:41:00.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So these are of historical importance to the country

asr-001346
01:41:00.080 --> 01:41:04.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and some of it really necessitates or time of the essence

asr-001347
01:41:04.080 --> 01:41:08.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because the film is already deteriorating.

asr-001348
01:41:08.080 --> 01:41:15.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So the total amount request for the Film Heritage Preservation Program is 51 million.

asr-001349
01:41:16.080 --> 01:41:20.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then lastly for the General Management Services,

asr-001350
01:41:20.080 --> 01:41:22.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: we are also requesting additional 2 million

asr-001351
01:41:22.080 --> 01:41:26.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for the distributed antenna system for Philippine Film Heritage Building

asr-001352
01:41:26.080 --> 01:41:33.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because as it is right now, there is no signal in the building.

asr-001353
01:41:33.080 --> 01:41:37.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And we usually have events because we have a Cinemathèque in the building

asr-001354
01:41:37.080 --> 01:41:41.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: so we are bringing in a lot of people, students in the area

asr-001355
01:41:41.080 --> 01:41:44.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and we don't have signal because it's a dead spot.

asr-001356
01:41:44.080 --> 01:41:49.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And another 2 million for the quality ISO certification

asr-001357
01:41:49.080 --> 01:41:54.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because we are hoping that the agency would be ISO certified as well.

asr-001358
01:41:54.080 --> 01:41:58.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then hopefully we could also come up with another behind the reel

asr-001359
01:41:58.080 --> 01:42:01.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: CISO next year amounting to 3.2 million.

asr-001360
01:42:01.080 --> 01:42:06.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: It's important because it allows the young generation of filmmakers

asr-001361
01:42:06.080 --> 01:42:13.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: to have access to discussions among key personalities in the industry

asr-001362
01:42:13.080 --> 01:42:15.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: or pillars of the industry.

asr-001363
01:42:15.080 --> 01:42:21.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Next is a 1.5 million request for the procurement of the humidifiers

asr-001364
01:42:21.080 --> 01:42:23.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: for Cinemathèque centers.

asr-001365
01:42:23.080 --> 01:42:30.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: It's because the building design requires us to have the humidifiers

asr-001366
01:42:30.080 --> 01:42:33.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because right now because of its design,

asr-001367
01:42:33.080 --> 01:42:38.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: it grows a lot of molds whenever we have this rainy season.

asr-001368
01:42:38.080 --> 01:42:42.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So we are also requesting additional 1.5 million for that.

asr-001369
01:42:43.080 --> 01:42:48.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So a total of 8.7 million for the GMS or the General Management Service.

asr-001370
01:42:48.080 --> 01:43:00.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Total breakdown for the wishlist that we have is 311 million pesos.

asr-001371
01:43:00.080 --> 01:43:04.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And I would like to pass on the floor to our chairman.

asr-001372
01:43:04.080 --> 01:43:07.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Just some points of clarification why the Cinemathèque

asr-001373
01:43:07.080 --> 01:43:09.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Oh, I'm sorry.

asr-001374
01:43:09.080 --> 01:43:12.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Just a point of clarification why the Cinemathèque.

asr-001375
01:43:12.080 --> 01:43:17.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: The Cinemathèque are micro cinemas which are located in various provinces.

asr-001376
01:43:17.080 --> 01:43:22.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: There is one in Bacolo, there is one in Iloilo, and there is one in Davao.

asr-001377
01:43:22.080 --> 01:43:28.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: But then we hopefully will be able to build more Cinemathèque before 2028

asr-001378
01:43:28.080 --> 01:43:31.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: when this administration would have to step down

asr-001379
01:43:31.080 --> 01:43:34.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: being coterminous with the present administration.

asr-001380
01:43:34.080 --> 01:43:35.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Why the Cinemathèque?

asr-001381
01:43:35.080 --> 01:43:38.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Because these are not only venues for showing films

asr-001382
01:43:38.080 --> 01:43:40.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: but it has become also a cultural hub

asr-001383
01:43:40.080 --> 01:43:42.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: for regional filmmakers to get together

asr-001384
01:43:42.080 --> 01:43:45.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and have their activities in these various venues.

asr-001385
01:43:45.080 --> 01:43:48.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: So it's almost an imperative, it's almost a need

asr-001386
01:43:48.080 --> 01:43:56.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: for, you know, to provide the venue for regional filmmakers

asr-001387
01:43:56.080 --> 01:44:00.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: as well as cinemathèque

asr-001388
01:44:00.080 --> 01:44:06.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to see the problem

asr-001389
01:44:10.080 --> 01:44:16.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to see the problem of digitalization.

asr-001390
01:44:16.080 --> 01:44:19.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: I've done over 100 films as a director

asr-001391
01:44:19.080 --> 01:44:24.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and I've come to realize that maybe 80% of them are already dead films.

asr-001392
01:44:24.080 --> 01:44:30.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Because if you allow these, especially those shot in cells as negatives

asr-001393
01:44:30.080 --> 01:44:33.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: the level of deterioration is very quick.

asr-001394
01:44:33.080 --> 01:44:37.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Now, unless we are able to preserve these, to digitize these

asr-001395
01:44:37.080 --> 01:44:39.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and preserve these immediately

asr-001396
01:44:39.080 --> 01:44:42.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: we might even lose more films.

asr-001397
01:44:42.080 --> 01:44:47.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: What is so sad is some of the masterpieces we have restored

asr-001398
01:44:47.080 --> 01:44:50.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: were not recovered here in our country but abroad.

asr-001399
01:44:50.080 --> 01:44:53.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: So these are some major priorities.

asr-001400
01:44:53.080 --> 01:44:57.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: We also have a priority, Mr. Chairman, in terms of incentives.

asr-001401
01:44:57.080 --> 01:45:00.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Mapakatotoo na tayo na hindi natin kayang pantayan ang incentives

asr-001402
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:03.920
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: na binibigay ng ibang bansa dahil sila ay mas mayaman

asr-001403
01:45:03.920 --> 01:45:07.680
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: at ang gobyerno nila ay mas may maluwag na magbigay ng pera

asr-001404
01:45:07.680 --> 01:45:11.020
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: para mahingkayat ang mga tao na mag-shoot sa kanila.

asr-001405
01:45:11.480 --> 01:45:15.340
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ang ating tanging panlawan lamang ay magagaling ang mga Pilipino

asr-001406
01:45:15.340 --> 01:45:19.120
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: sa kanilang ginagawa at tayo ay nagsasalita ng wikang Ingles.

asr-001407
01:45:19.420 --> 01:45:22.140
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya mas madali para sa foreigners na pumunta dito.

asr-001408
01:45:22.780 --> 01:45:27.880
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ang laki-laking economic benefit kapag nagsushoot dito ang mga foreigners.

asr-001409
01:45:27.880 --> 01:45:32.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Why? Number one, hindi lamang yung mga tao sa pelikula ang kumikita.

asr-001410
01:45:32.440 --> 01:45:33.700
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: May exchange of technology.

asr-001411
01:45:34.200 --> 01:45:37.920
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: At ikalawa, ang daming ancillary businesses na nakikinabang

asr-001412
01:45:37.920 --> 01:45:39.440
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: tuwing may nagsushooting dito.

asr-001413
01:45:41.220 --> 01:45:44.820
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Wishful thinking ito na sana mas matulungan at sana mas madagdagan

asr-001414
01:45:44.820 --> 01:45:46.400
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ang incentives na magbibigay natin.

asr-001415
01:45:46.500 --> 01:45:50.300
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: But we're also being very realistic in terms of the priorities of the government

asr-001416
01:45:50.300 --> 01:45:52.060
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: as to where they would put the tax pay.

asr-001417
01:45:52.080 --> 01:45:54.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Chairman, let me cut in.

asr-001418
01:45:56.640 --> 01:45:57.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Could it be?

asr-001419
01:45:57.880 --> 01:46:01.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Could it be na incentives lang kaya hindi tayo makapaghikay?

asr-001420
01:46:01.780 --> 01:46:03.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or there may be other reasons.

asr-001421
01:46:04.000 --> 01:46:08.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Are you also looking to the fact na maaring peace and order

asr-001422
01:46:08.100 --> 01:46:12.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kaya ayaw pumunta dito ng mga artista or political turmoil

asr-001423
01:46:12.400 --> 01:46:17.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na medyo turn off para sa kanila, na medyo magulo tayo dito,

asr-001424
01:46:17.640 --> 01:46:22.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: nag-aaway, may mga kinasuhan ng mga opisyal ng gobyerno.

asr-001425
01:46:22.620 --> 01:46:26.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Couldn't be some of those are some of the reasons kung bakit

asr-001426
01:46:26.320 --> 01:46:27.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na turn off sila.

asr-001427
01:46:27.880 --> 01:46:29.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bakit ako magsushoot dyan?

asr-001428
01:46:29.460 --> 01:46:34.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Rally dito, rally doon, sigawan dito, yung vicepresidente nila nandoon,

asr-001429
01:46:34.140 --> 01:46:39.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kinakasuhan, yung mga opisyal nila nakakulong, ilang mga miyembro na senado,

asr-001430
01:46:40.180 --> 01:46:46.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: et cetera, or I would siguro prefer a place na kamukha na Pilipinas pero tahimik,

asr-001431
01:46:46.520 --> 01:46:48.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: like Thailand, tahimik siya.

asr-001432
01:46:48.640 --> 01:46:52.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: E dito lang tayo kaysa baka mapunta tayo, madamay tayo sa gulo.

asr-001433
01:46:52.040 --> 01:46:56.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi niyo ba naisip yan na maaring hindi lang doon sa incentive?

asr-001434
01:46:57.000 --> 01:46:57.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ano?

asr-001435
01:46:57.480 --> 01:46:58.900
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Naka-factor in na rin po yun.

asr-001436
01:46:59.040 --> 01:47:03.980
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Naka-factor in po yun dahil ang perception ng mundo sa Pilipinas,

asr-001437
01:47:04.140 --> 01:47:07.260
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: lalo-lalo na sa ngayon at kung ano-ano ang lumalabas sa balita

asr-001438
01:47:07.260 --> 01:47:10.480
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: at hinahighlight ng balita ay isang factor yan.

asr-001439
01:47:10.840 --> 01:47:14.020
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Pero ang napaka katakataka, hindi naman katakataka,

asr-001440
01:47:14.160 --> 01:47:16.740
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ang lalo nakakalakas ng loob, Mr. Chair,

asr-001441
01:47:17.240 --> 01:47:18.720
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: is na dito pa rin sila pumupunta.

asr-001442
01:47:19.420 --> 01:47:22.100
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay, in spite and despite, dito pa rin sila pumupunta.

asr-001443
01:47:22.100 --> 01:47:26.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Pero hindi po natin mapapagkaila na ang perception nila ng Pilipinas

asr-001444
01:47:26.200 --> 01:47:29.620
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ay a very big factor in not only in the movie industry

asr-001445
01:47:29.620 --> 01:47:31.440
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: but the entire business setup.

asr-001446
01:47:32.080 --> 01:47:33.580
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay, naka-factor in po yan.

asr-001447
01:47:34.140 --> 01:47:34.400
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay.

asr-001448
01:47:35.280 --> 01:47:39.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay, my next question will be

asr-001449
01:47:39.820 --> 01:47:46.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung hinihingi po ninyong proposed budget na 425 million, ano po,

asr-001450
01:47:47.140 --> 01:47:49.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: pero 314 million lamang nasa NEP.

asr-001451
01:47:50.980 --> 01:47:54.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At meron pa kayong 311 million na sa wish list.

asr-001452
01:47:54.800 --> 01:47:55.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, so,

asr-001453
01:47:55.320 --> 01:47:57.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: if kukumputin ho ninyo yan,

asr-001454
01:47:58.060 --> 01:48:01.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: parang bakit po umahabot sa 625 million

asr-001455
01:48:01.360 --> 01:48:03.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ang inyong total funding requirement

asr-001456
01:48:03.260 --> 01:48:08.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kung 425 million lamang ang inyong original proposal, Ms. Rachel?

asr-001457
01:48:08.760 --> 01:48:12.260
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Actually po, one is for the film restoration.

asr-001458
01:48:13.540 --> 01:48:19.100
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: The team who's handling the restoration has submitted us their proposal

asr-001459
01:48:19.100 --> 01:48:21.020
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: which is amounting to 50 million.

asr-001460
01:48:21.300 --> 01:48:24.960
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Just recently, when they were able to identify,

asr-001461
01:48:25.320 --> 01:48:25.960
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: the titles.

asr-001462
01:48:26.460 --> 01:48:30.420
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And that was even before the budget call of the DBM

asr-001463
01:48:30.420 --> 01:48:35.800
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: was conducted early January or January this year.

asr-001464
01:48:35.800 --> 01:48:39.080
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And then for the additional budget, again,

asr-001465
01:48:39.260 --> 01:48:40.640
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: is from the incentives

asr-001466
01:48:40.640 --> 01:48:44.420
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because the cycle 2 opened last September

asr-001467
01:48:44.420 --> 01:48:47.240
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and several film productions,

asr-001468
01:48:47.580 --> 01:48:49.760
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: both for foreign and local, have applied.

asr-001469
01:48:50.400 --> 01:48:52.100
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And they're all good projects.

asr-001470
01:48:52.640 --> 01:48:54.800
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: And based on their application,

asr-001471
01:48:55.320 --> 01:48:59.480
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: again, they are spending a lot here in the country.

asr-001472
01:48:59.760 --> 01:49:04.260
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So, we're just wondering if we can give more

asr-001473
01:49:04.260 --> 01:49:08.860
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: or we can accept more applications

asr-001474
01:49:08.860 --> 01:49:12.120
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: and approve their applications for the incentives

asr-001475
01:49:12.120 --> 01:49:15.820
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: because they might look for another country

asr-001476
01:49:15.820 --> 01:49:20.040
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: or alternative country if we don't give that incentives to them.

asr-001477
01:49:20.440 --> 01:49:24.320
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: We just finalized the deliberation last month.

asr-001478
01:49:24.320 --> 01:49:24.760
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So,

asr-001479
01:49:25.320 --> 01:49:31.100
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: those budgets are factored in in our wish list that was presented earlier.

asr-001480
01:49:31.600 --> 01:49:33.260
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: If I can add to that, Mr. Chair,

asr-001481
01:49:33.520 --> 01:49:35.700
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: kasalanan ko yung isa yun sa preservation

asr-001482
01:49:35.700 --> 01:49:39.320
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: kasi pinahanap ko kung ano pa yung mga magagandang pelikula

asr-001483
01:49:39.320 --> 01:49:41.840
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: na maa-access natin na pwedeng ma-restore.

asr-001484
01:49:42.180 --> 01:49:43.780
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: And it takes time to find all these

asr-001485
01:49:43.780 --> 01:49:45.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: until we came up with a list na,

asr-001486
01:49:45.160 --> 01:49:46.260
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ay, ito pa lang, restorable.

asr-001487
01:49:46.660 --> 01:49:48.240
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya hindi na-factor in yun sa una.

asr-001488
01:49:48.360 --> 01:49:50.440
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: At sa kakalawa, maganda po yung problema na

asr-001489
01:49:50.440 --> 01:49:51.840
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ang dami-dami nag-a-apply

asr-001490
01:49:51.840 --> 01:49:54.880
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: na kumuha ng mga grants and incentives

asr-001491
01:49:54.880 --> 01:49:57.000
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to be able to shoot here in the country

asr-001492
01:49:57.000 --> 01:49:57.920
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and at the same time

asr-001493
01:49:57.920 --> 01:50:00.560
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to have Philippine film workers

asr-001494
01:50:00.560 --> 01:50:02.920
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: join in in these productions.

asr-001495
01:50:03.120 --> 01:50:04.440
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: So, it's a good problem

asr-001496
01:50:04.440 --> 01:50:06.760
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: which eventually became a budgetary problem.

asr-001497
01:50:06.760 --> 01:50:09.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Going back to film restoration,

asr-001498
01:50:10.420 --> 01:50:12.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: how does the FDCP ensure

asr-001499
01:50:12.780 --> 01:50:16.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: that restoring a project or a film

asr-001500
01:50:16.560 --> 01:50:19.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: is technically feasible and cost-effective

asr-001501
01:50:19.520 --> 01:50:22.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: before public funds are allocated?

asr-001502
01:50:22.520 --> 01:50:23.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Baka di naman natin mabawi.

asr-001503
01:50:23.840 --> 01:50:24.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Baka wala nang,

asr-001504
01:50:24.880 --> 01:50:25.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung mga interest,

asr-001505
01:50:25.560 --> 01:50:27.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung mga black and white,

asr-001506
01:50:27.660 --> 01:50:28.880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: naging brown and white,

asr-001507
01:50:29.020 --> 01:50:30.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: may manunood pa ba noon?

asr-001508
01:50:30.120 --> 01:50:31.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi na kilala ng mga kabataan ngayon,

asr-001509
01:50:32.080 --> 01:50:34.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga nangamatay na yung mga tao na yun.

asr-001510
01:50:34.680 --> 01:50:37.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And baka boring yung sa inyo,

asr-001511
01:50:37.760 --> 01:50:39.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga film directors, of course.

asr-001512
01:50:39.420 --> 01:50:40.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Meron po kayong keen,

asr-001513
01:50:40.620 --> 01:50:42.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: may eye po kayo na maganda ito.

asr-001514
01:50:42.240 --> 01:50:44.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero sa ordinary viewer,

asr-001515
01:50:44.500 --> 01:50:45.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: lalo mga kabataan ngayon,

asr-001516
01:50:45.780 --> 01:50:47.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga Gen Z, Gen X, Gen Y,

asr-001517
01:50:48.480 --> 01:50:53.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: eh, hindi sa kanila ikang kaakit-akit.

asr-001518
01:50:54.000 --> 01:50:54.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: I'll answer.

asr-001519
01:50:54.880 --> 01:50:56.380
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: I'll answer that in two points, Mr. Chair.

asr-001520
01:50:56.480 --> 01:50:58.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Firstly, before we restore a film,

asr-001521
01:50:59.000 --> 01:51:01.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: we make sure that the film is still restorable.

asr-001522
01:51:01.840 --> 01:51:02.060
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay?

asr-001523
01:51:02.200 --> 01:51:03.880
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: We have technical people assessing

asr-001524
01:51:03.880 --> 01:51:05.040
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: the state of the negative

asr-001525
01:51:05.040 --> 01:51:06.060
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: or the state of the print

asr-001526
01:51:06.060 --> 01:51:07.600
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: if it is still accessible

asr-001527
01:51:07.600 --> 01:51:09.760
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: or it is still restorable.

asr-001528
01:51:11.260 --> 01:51:13.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: There are certain cases in which

asr-001529
01:51:13.200 --> 01:51:15.380
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: the film is just so damaged

asr-001530
01:51:15.380 --> 01:51:17.140
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: that we don't pursue it anymore

asr-001531
01:51:17.140 --> 01:51:19.260
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: because it's going to cause an arm and a leg

asr-001532
01:51:19.260 --> 01:51:20.700
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and your next reincarnation

asr-001533
01:51:20.700 --> 01:51:22.780
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: in order to completely restore it.

asr-001534
01:51:22.780 --> 01:51:23.500
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ikalawa,

asr-001535
01:51:23.500 --> 01:51:25.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: about the new generation

asr-001536
01:51:25.200 --> 01:51:26.360
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: appreciating old films.

asr-001537
01:51:26.480 --> 01:51:28.060
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: I will use an example of what happened

asr-001538
01:51:28.060 --> 01:51:29.540
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: last September 4

asr-001539
01:51:29.540 --> 01:51:30.660
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: at the opening of the

asr-001540
01:51:30.660 --> 01:51:32.040
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Philippine Film Industry Month.

asr-001541
01:51:32.360 --> 01:51:33.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: For the first time,

asr-001542
01:51:33.460 --> 01:51:36.360
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ang mga Gen Z at Gen Y and Gen X

asr-001543
01:51:36.360 --> 01:51:37.500
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: napanood ang tinimbangka,

asr-001544
01:51:38.280 --> 01:51:38.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ngunit kulang.

asr-001545
01:51:39.340 --> 01:51:40.620
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: At nagulat sila.

asr-001546
01:51:40.960 --> 01:51:41.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001547
01:51:41.980 --> 01:51:44.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi kayo, baka mga yung nanood na yun

asr-001548
01:51:44.040 --> 01:51:45.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ay mga estudyante

asr-001549
01:51:46.060 --> 01:51:47.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na mga ang courses nila

asr-001550
01:51:47.540 --> 01:51:48.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ay nasa film.

asr-001551
01:51:48.660 --> 01:51:49.680
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ay, ay, hindi po.

asr-001552
01:51:49.920 --> 01:51:50.460
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Hindi po.

asr-001553
01:51:50.520 --> 01:51:52.560
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: It was a real cross-section of people.

asr-001554
01:51:52.560 --> 01:51:53.420
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: And as a matter,

asr-001555
01:51:53.500 --> 01:51:53.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: a real fact,

asr-001556
01:51:54.120 --> 01:51:55.160
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: may mga request kami

asr-001557
01:51:55.160 --> 01:51:57.100
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to show the film commercially.

asr-001558
01:51:57.720 --> 01:51:59.100
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay, to make it more accessible

asr-001559
01:51:59.100 --> 01:52:00.680
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: in commercial cinemas.

asr-001560
01:52:01.140 --> 01:52:01.820
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya lang,

asr-001561
01:52:02.140 --> 01:52:03.300
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ito, ang tragedy niyan,

asr-001562
01:52:03.720 --> 01:52:05.660
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: yung arming agreement

asr-001563
01:52:05.660 --> 01:52:06.980
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: sa showing ng tinimbang

asr-001564
01:52:06.980 --> 01:52:08.440
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: has to be non-commercial.

asr-001565
01:52:08.860 --> 01:52:10.960
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kasi hindi na pag-aari ng Pilipinas

asr-001566
01:52:10.960 --> 01:52:11.820
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ang tinimbang.

asr-001567
01:52:12.240 --> 01:52:13.240
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Pag-aari na ito

asr-001568
01:52:13.240 --> 01:52:14.560
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ng isang French company.

asr-001569
01:52:15.000 --> 01:52:16.160
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: And for order for us

asr-001570
01:52:16.160 --> 01:52:17.240
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to be able to show it,

asr-001571
01:52:17.400 --> 01:52:18.660
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: we need permission from them

asr-001572
01:52:18.660 --> 01:52:20.040
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: and the permission requires

asr-001573
01:52:20.040 --> 01:52:20.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: it's non-commercial.

asr-001574
01:52:20.860 --> 01:52:22.320
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: So we can only show it

asr-001575
01:52:22.320 --> 01:52:22.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: in cinematext

asr-001576
01:52:23.500 --> 01:52:24.560
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: or special festivals.

asr-001577
01:52:25.040 --> 01:52:26.240
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Pero meron pong clamor.

asr-001578
01:52:26.540 --> 01:52:27.320
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Meron pong clamor.

asr-001579
01:52:27.600 --> 01:52:29.920
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Noong in-announce namin

asr-001580
01:52:29.920 --> 01:52:31.600
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: na ipapalabas ang relasyon

asr-001581
01:52:31.600 --> 01:52:32.740
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: ni Vilma Santos

asr-001582
01:52:32.740 --> 01:52:34.800
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: at ni Christopher De Leon

asr-001583
01:52:34.800 --> 01:52:37.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: by the national artist

asr-001584
01:52:37.200 --> 01:52:38.100
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ismael Bernal,

asr-001585
01:52:38.880 --> 01:52:40.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: the excitement was just electric.

asr-001586
01:52:41.680 --> 01:52:42.820
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Even in cinematext,

asr-001587
01:52:42.880 --> 01:52:44.000
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: I would greatly attribute it

asr-001588
01:52:44.000 --> 01:52:44.640
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: to the fact that

asr-001589
01:52:44.640 --> 01:52:46.000
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: sa Intermoros,

asr-001590
01:52:46.060 --> 01:52:46.760
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: we're right in the hub

asr-001591
01:52:46.760 --> 01:52:47.740
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: of various schools.

asr-001592
01:52:48.600 --> 01:52:50.820
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Never na bakante ang cinematext

asr-001593
01:52:50.820 --> 01:52:52.540
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: at ang mga bata ang nanonood.

asr-001594
01:52:52.540 --> 01:52:54.040
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: At ito yung mga bata

asr-001595
01:52:54.040 --> 01:52:55.860
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: na hindi lamang nag-aaral ng pelikula

asr-001596
01:52:55.860 --> 01:52:57.080
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: but these are students

asr-001597
01:52:57.080 --> 01:52:58.200
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: of various disciplines

asr-001598
01:52:58.200 --> 01:52:59.500
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: who are interested

asr-001599
01:52:59.500 --> 01:53:01.300
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: in watching a free movie.

asr-001600
01:53:01.760 --> 01:53:02.020
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Okay?

asr-001601
01:53:02.460 --> 01:53:03.560
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: And we're showing them classics.

asr-001602
01:53:03.840 --> 01:53:04.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes.

asr-001603
01:53:04.340 --> 01:53:04.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Right.

asr-001604
01:53:05.100 --> 01:53:06.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sir, nabanggit po ninyo

asr-001605
01:53:06.980 --> 01:53:08.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung cinematext.

asr-001606
01:53:09.620 --> 01:53:11.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How often do we use this?

asr-001607
01:53:11.840 --> 01:53:13.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi you're saying na

asr-001608
01:53:13.240 --> 01:53:14.560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: we have to construct more.

asr-001609
