02:03:58.220 --> 02:04:01.660
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya rin po may program kami yung Pilikula ng Bayan.

asr-002004
02:04:02.460 --> 02:04:08.280
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Nagpapalabas kami for free sa mga open spaces, sa mga LGU endorsed spaces.

asr-002005
02:04:08.660 --> 02:04:13.220
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Para makapanood tulad nung kabataan ko, nanonood ako ng sine sa basketball court.

asr-002006
02:04:14.160 --> 02:04:14.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-002007
02:04:14.740 --> 02:04:19.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya rin po ba yung pag-i-inspect sa mga sinihan na yan or is it MTRCB?

asr-002008
02:04:20.000 --> 02:04:20.840
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: MTRCB po yan.

asr-002009
02:04:20.860 --> 02:04:26.020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na ikang conducive pa rin na pag may sunog, maka-exit yung mga tao.

asr-002010
02:04:26.320 --> 02:04:26.940
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: MTRCB yan.

asr-002011
02:04:26.940 --> 02:04:31.380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ah, kasi nung bata ako, nakapunta ako, nanonood ako ng pelikula.

asr-002012
02:04:31.680 --> 02:04:34.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Paglabas ko, kamot ako ng kamot, ang dami na palang surot.

asr-002013
02:04:35.360 --> 02:04:36.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung iba naman, munti ako nadulas.

asr-002014
02:04:37.020 --> 02:04:43.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pagpasok ko sa sear, napakadulas dahil yung pelikula po, X-rated, Susmar Yosef.

asr-002015
02:04:43.680 --> 02:04:46.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya mabuti, wala ko nakita mga tiyanak ko doon.

asr-002016
02:04:47.080 --> 02:04:52.440
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Trabaho nyo ba yung kaninong trabaho yan na yung sinihan maganda pa rin naman?

asr-002017
02:04:52.700 --> 02:04:55.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na yung worth yung binabayad mo?

asr-002018
02:04:55.640 --> 02:04:56.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

asr-002019
02:04:56.940 --> 02:04:59.600
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya lahat po yan, ang City Engineer's Office ang in-charge doon.

asr-002020
02:04:59.920 --> 02:05:04.420
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Ang sa MTRCB, yung mga himalang nagaganap sa loob ng sinihan.

asr-002021
02:05:05.080 --> 02:05:07.740
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Dati po, may mga raid pa po ganun.

asr-002022
02:05:07.960 --> 02:05:08.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Oo.

asr-002023
02:05:09.060 --> 02:05:09.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yun yung mga...

asr-002024
02:05:09.920 --> 02:05:13.200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dalawang tao, yung isa walang ulo, yung isa...

asr-002025
02:05:13.200 --> 02:05:14.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung dami yung nahuhulim na mga players.

asr-002026
02:05:14.320 --> 02:05:15.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dami rin po yan.

asr-002027
02:05:15.560 --> 02:05:18.060
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kamisang po sa comfort room, apat ang paa, hindi ba?

asr-002028
02:05:18.600 --> 02:05:22.960
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kaya lahat po yan, trabaho po yan ng mga deputy ng MTRCB.

asr-002029
02:05:22.960 --> 02:05:25.900
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: At saka yun naman sa structural, sa City Engineer's Office.

asr-002030
02:05:25.940 --> 02:05:25.960
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Kung...

asr-002031
02:05:26.940 --> 02:05:28.700
FDCP Chairman Jose Javier Reyes: Lalo po yung mga fire exits.

asr-002032
02:05:28.840 --> 02:05:29.140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yeah.

asr-002033
02:05:29.400 --> 02:05:30.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Apo, importante po yan.

asr-002034
02:05:30.240 --> 02:05:31.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, okay.

asr-002035
02:05:31.520 --> 02:05:33.240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anyway, sir, last na lang po.

asr-002036
02:05:33.780 --> 02:05:39.080
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ang absorption po ng FDCP sa OMBI under the special provision po ng GAAP.

asr-002037
02:05:39.620 --> 02:05:40.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Batas na po yan.

asr-002038
02:05:40.640 --> 02:05:42.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi ba dapat sundin na?

asr-002039
02:05:44.120 --> 02:05:50.540
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: In as much as we want, Mr. Chair, pero we are also bounded by the Optimization Act,

asr-002040
02:05:50.620 --> 02:05:51.820
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: Government Optimization Act.

asr-002041
02:05:51.820 --> 02:05:55.820
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: So, ang advice din po ng DBM at CSC, we have to go through the submission of...

asr-002042
02:05:56.940 --> 02:06:08.860
FDCP Executive Director Rachelle Villaluna: the optimization plan and then they will have a hearing for that and discuss if there's really a need for the FDCP to absorb the personnel of OMBI.

asr-002043
02:06:09.400 --> 02:06:10.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright, thank you.

asr-002044
02:06:10.480 --> 02:06:26.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Well, since there are no more questions from this chair, the fiscal year 2027 proposed budget of the Film Development Council of the Philippines now being submitted for plenary consideration subject to the discussions and submission.

asr-002045
02:06:26.840 --> 02:06:28.060
Senator Erwin Tulfo: of requested documents.

asr-002046
02:06:28.260 --> 02:06:28.600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you.

asr-002047
02:06:29.100 --> 02:06:32.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: The FDCP delegation is permitted to leave the room.

asr-002048
02:06:32.480 --> 02:06:32.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, po.

asr-002049
02:06:33.260 --> 02:06:33.840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, po.

asr-002050
02:06:37.140 --> 02:06:38.420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hearing suspended.

asr-002088
02:08:56.840 --> 02:09:02.740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: We now proceed with the presentation of the proposed budget of the Philippine Racing Commission.

asr-002089
02:09:03.340 --> 02:09:08.620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Chairman de Leon, please proceed with your presentation and thank you for patiently waiting.

asr-002090
02:09:09.400 --> 02:09:15.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Dr. Edwin, Mr. Chair, salamat sa opportunity for us to present our budget for 2027.

asr-002091
02:09:16.060 --> 02:09:25.460
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: As we all know, Philippine Racing Commission created 52 years ago by Presidential Decree No. 420 by President Marcos Sr.

asr-002092
02:09:25.460 --> 02:09:32.440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, we are mandated to provide employment to the Philippine people and generate taxes for the government.

asr-002093
02:09:33.480 --> 02:09:40.060
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So far, we are providing more than 5,000 direct and indirect employment to the Philippine people.

asr-002094
02:09:40.680 --> 02:09:46.420
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: And at the same time, we are also producing OFW to Japan, Australia, and other parts of the country.

asr-002095
02:09:47.140 --> 02:09:52.000
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: As of now, there are more than 2,000 OFW in Japan alone.

asr-002096
02:09:52.800 --> 02:09:55.420
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: That came from the Philippine horse racing industry.

asr-002097
02:09:56.180 --> 02:10:01.340
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, we are mandated to provide government revenue every year.

asr-002098
02:10:01.960 --> 02:10:08.780
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: At the average, for the last five years, we are providing 700 million to 800 million per year to the government.

asr-002099
02:10:09.680 --> 02:10:17.380
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: The budget that is being given to us by the government is only one-fifth of the total revenue that we are giving.

asr-002100
02:10:17.900 --> 02:10:22.560
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: If they give us 200 million, we are returning 800 million to the government.

asr-002101
02:10:23.180 --> 02:10:23.740
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So,

asr-002102
02:10:25.460 --> 02:10:34.140
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: we are mandated to supervise the horse racing, at the same time, the breeding industry in the Philippines.

asr-002103
02:10:35.760 --> 02:10:38.760
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Horse racing in the Philippines started 159 years ago.

asr-002104
02:10:39.620 --> 02:10:45.220
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, we are ahead of some other nations in Asia and worldwide.

asr-002105
02:10:46.400 --> 02:10:53.280
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: This is the only industry or sports industry that is accepted by more than 140 countries worldwide.

asr-002106
02:10:54.380 --> 02:10:55.100
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So,

asr-002107
02:10:55.460 --> 02:11:03.340
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: as we observed in the last five years when we traveled to other conferences in the Asian Racing Federation,

asr-002108
02:11:04.060 --> 02:11:08.220
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: International Federation of Horse Racing Authority, and APAR,

asr-002109
02:11:09.640 --> 02:11:21.840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: we found out that horse racing is really the only sport or one of the very few sports in the Philippines that can be converted to a sports tourism industry.

asr-002110
02:11:22.800 --> 02:11:24.260
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, all sectors,

asr-002111
02:11:24.260 --> 02:11:24.760
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: you know,

asr-002112
02:11:24.760 --> 02:11:25.440
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: IPO observed,

asr-002113
02:11:25.460 --> 02:11:34.160
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: from the King of Saudi Arabia to the different royalties in Europe, are all into horse racing.

asr-002114
02:11:35.160 --> 02:11:39.480
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, we are left behind, Mr. Chair, for so many years.

asr-002115
02:11:39.640 --> 02:11:44.360
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Napabayaan po ito ng mga nakalang administrasyon at hindi nakita yung potential nito.

asr-002116
02:11:45.300 --> 02:11:46.560
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: To give you an example,

asr-002117
02:11:47.560 --> 02:11:48.480
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: right now,

asr-002118
02:11:48.900 --> 02:11:49.800
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Japan,

asr-002119
02:11:50.500 --> 02:11:52.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: in terms of peso sales per year,

asr-002120
02:11:52.840 --> 02:11:54.240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: is selling 1.3 trillion pesos per year.

asr-002121
02:11:54.520 --> 02:11:55.240
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: 1.3 trillion pesos per year.

asr-002122
02:11:55.460 --> 02:12:03.060
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: While Korea, right now, is selling 700 billion pesos per year.

asr-002123
02:12:03.720 --> 02:12:08.960
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: So, we are of the same number in terms of horses as of Korea.

asr-002124
02:12:09.700 --> 02:12:13.320
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: If they are selling 700 billion pesos a year,

asr-002125
02:12:13.680 --> 02:12:16.820
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: and we are just targeting 10 billion so far,

asr-002126
02:12:17.800 --> 02:12:19.060
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: napakalayo po ng depensya.

asr-002127
02:12:19.060 --> 02:12:25.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May I intercut you there, Mr. Chairman?

asr-002128
02:12:25.560 --> 02:12:29.120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Could it be the reason why mahina po ang sales natin?

asr-002129
02:12:29.240 --> 02:12:35.280
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi yung mga off-track betting stations natin ay hindi masyadong kagandahan ng lugar.

asr-002130
02:12:35.500 --> 02:12:36.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Unlike in Japan.

asr-002131
02:12:37.080 --> 02:12:40.480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I've been there to Japan, talagang malalaking building po.

asr-002132
02:12:40.500 --> 02:12:41.020
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po kayo.

asr-002133
02:12:41.360 --> 02:12:43.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Exactly. Air-conditioned.

asr-002134
02:12:43.960 --> 02:12:45.500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ganon din po sa Korea.

asr-002135
02:12:46.220 --> 02:12:48.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sa atin po dito, yung OTV.

asr-002136
02:12:48.720 --> 02:12:50.000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Diyan sa isang karinderiya.

asr-002137
02:12:50.240 --> 02:12:50.720
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po.

asr-002138
02:12:50.720 --> 02:12:51.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Na napaka-init.

asr-002139
02:12:52.020 --> 02:12:52.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Manunod ang TV.

asr-002140
02:12:53.020 --> 02:12:54.040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ganito kalaki lang po.

asr-002141
02:12:54.180 --> 02:12:54.340
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama.

asr-002142
02:12:54.340 --> 02:12:55.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kailangan po mag-television.

asr-002143
02:12:55.300 --> 02:12:55.860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Teleskopyo.

asr-002144
02:12:55.940 --> 02:12:56.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Para mapanood mo.

asr-002145
02:12:57.140 --> 02:12:57.580
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po.

asr-002146
02:12:57.600 --> 02:13:01.680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pagkatapos pagbayaran, nakasimangot pa yung kahera pag nanalo.

asr-002147
02:13:02.060 --> 02:13:03.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May tao po ako dati.

asr-002148
02:13:03.940 --> 02:13:04.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yun ang trabaho.

asr-002149
02:13:05.420 --> 02:13:06.760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nagkakarera tuwing hapon.

asr-002150
02:13:07.580 --> 02:13:09.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nagrereklamo dahil napakahaba pa ng pila.

asr-002151
02:13:10.100 --> 02:13:11.460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Doon po, systematic.

asr-002152
02:13:12.160 --> 02:13:16.160
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pag saksak mo ng card, pag nanalo, bayad sa iyo.

asr-002153
02:13:16.380 --> 02:13:16.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dito.

asr-002154
02:13:16.900 --> 02:13:18.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So I think there's a big difference.

asr-002155
02:13:18.960 --> 02:13:21.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya gusto mo mangarera,

asr-002156
02:13:22.400 --> 02:13:25.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: ay ang karinderiya, ang sinaserve lang po, beer.

asr-002157
02:13:25.300 --> 02:13:27.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Eh hindi ko, paano kung hindi umiinom ng beer?

asr-002158
02:13:27.380 --> 02:13:27.880
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po.

asr-002159
02:13:28.100 --> 02:13:30.800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos minsan, meron pa ho dyan sa may Quezon City.

asr-002160
02:13:31.120 --> 02:13:33.320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung sahig ng karinderiya, lupa.

asr-002161
02:13:33.700 --> 02:13:35.520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Dahil pag binaha, pagkuhan, maputik.

asr-002162
02:13:35.760 --> 02:13:36.260
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po.

asr-002163
02:13:36.380 --> 02:13:37.100
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002164
02:13:37.100 --> 02:13:41.100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I think we have to ikang up naman, upgrade po,

asr-002165
02:13:41.100 --> 02:13:45.340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung mga, paglalagyan natin ang mga off-track betting stations po natin,

asr-002166
02:13:45.340 --> 02:13:48.180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung mga OTDS, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002167
02:13:48.620 --> 02:13:50.400
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Mr. Chair, tama po lahat ng observation n'yo.

asr-002168
02:13:50.900 --> 02:13:53.820
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Nakataon lang po na ang Philippine Racing Commission

asr-002169
02:13:54.340 --> 02:13:55.260
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: is not a,

asr-002170
02:13:55.300 --> 02:13:58.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: our duty to approve the OTB application

asr-002171
02:13:58.300 --> 02:14:00.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: and the regulations of OTB operations.

asr-002172
02:14:00.300 --> 02:14:03.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: It is being, actually, handled by GOV.

asr-002173
02:14:03.300 --> 02:14:05.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: GOV, Games and Amusement Board.

asr-002174
02:14:05.300 --> 02:14:07.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Pero for the last five years po,

asr-002175
02:14:07.300 --> 02:14:10.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: nagpupumilit po kami na itaas ang antas ng OTB.

asr-002176
02:14:10.300 --> 02:14:11.800
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Nakita po namin yun.

asr-002177
02:14:11.800 --> 02:14:14.800
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: At ngayon po, unti-unti po nagkakaroon ng improvement.

asr-002178
02:14:14.800 --> 02:14:18.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Meron po kami mga OTB ngayon na umabot ng 100 square meter

asr-002179
02:14:18.300 --> 02:14:20.800
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: that can accommodate at least 60 to 80 people.

asr-002180
02:14:20.800 --> 02:14:24.800
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: And they are actually equipped with a big TV like what we have today.

asr-002181
02:14:25.300 --> 02:14:28.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: And air-conditioned and properly supervised.

asr-002182
02:14:28.300 --> 02:14:30.300
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Kami na po yung nakikialam ngayon.

asr-002183
02:14:30.300 --> 02:14:33.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Last week po, may nadaanan pa nga ako dito sa Maynila.

asr-002184
02:14:33.300 --> 02:14:34.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Parang sari-sari store lang.

asr-002185
02:14:34.300 --> 02:14:35.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nanonood.

asr-002186
02:14:35.300 --> 02:14:39.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Iipon yung mga tao dun sa, nanonood sila sa labas nung tindahan po eh.

asr-002187
02:14:39.300 --> 02:14:42.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos, kaya po, nagkakaproblema tayo.

asr-002188
02:14:42.300 --> 02:14:43.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: And is it true?

asr-002189
02:14:43.300 --> 02:14:52.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hanggang ngayon, marami pa rin po yung mga ika nga illegal na mga nag-ooperate pa ng illegal OTB.

asr-002190
02:14:52.300 --> 02:14:54.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Meron mga runner, yung mga bookies kung tawagin.

asr-002191
02:14:54.300 --> 02:14:59.300
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mukhang kinakain po yata yung sales ng mga bookies sa...

asr-002192
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:01.820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: sales po ng mga OTBs natin,

asr-002193
02:15:01.940 --> 02:15:02.640
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Chairman?

asr-002193-split-2
02:15:02.640 --> 02:15:03.280
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po, Mr.

asr-002194
02:15:03.760 --> 02:15:05.780
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Tama po, Mr. Chair. Actually, last year,

asr-002195
02:15:06.120 --> 02:15:07.840
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: we have 5.7 billion sales

asr-002196
02:15:07.840 --> 02:15:09.620
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: last year. This year, we will be having

asr-002197
02:15:09.620 --> 02:15:12.100
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: 6.8 billion sales this year.

asr-002198
02:15:12.780 --> 02:15:13.680
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: Ang OTB po,

asr-002199
02:15:13.800 --> 02:15:15.780
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: actually, katulad na sinabi ko

asr-002200
02:15:15.780 --> 02:15:17.640
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: kanina, pinamahalaan po ng

asr-002201
02:15:17.640 --> 02:15:18.900
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: GameCenter News Board, more

asr-002202
02:15:18.900 --> 02:15:21.520
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: GAV. Sa dami po ng trabaho ng GAV

asr-002203
02:15:21.520 --> 02:15:23.500
PHILRACOM Chairman Aurelio P. de Leon: ngayon, more than 80 na yung NSA

